# The architectures plugin-qualification-records is built for, and the machine classes each one carries: every set
# under records/<class>/ goes into the package of its class's architecture, at /usr/share/omx/qualification/<class>/.
# debian/rules (through tools/sets.py), the spec's per-architecture block and tools/sets.py check read this file.
#
# One line per class: the Debian architecture, the RPM architecture, the class, and the plugin-qualify range the
# package of that architecture depends on (from, and below). An architecture with two classes gives both the same
# range.
#
# deb arch  rpm arch  class   plugin-qualify from  below
amd64       x86_64    x86-64  0.20.1               0.21
arm64       aarch64   rpi5    0.20.0               0.21
